    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "OUR BALBRIGGAN"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Balbriggan is set to be transformed; its rejuvenation plan sets out an ambitious new vison shaped by the towns people. The total investment in physical, infrastructural improvements between 2020-2030 is currently projected at €54 – €57 million"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "The Our Balbriggan Rejuvenation programme is led by Fingal County Council’s Economic, Community & Cultural Development. A Leadership Group chaired by Dr. David Begg is responsible for stewardship and progress on all aspects of the Rejuvenation Plan."
    }
   ],
